Pass the `verifyUser` option to `basicAuth` instead of a fixed username and password. It is a function `(username, password, c) => boolean | Promise<boolean>` that verifies the user [4], and returning `true` means the user is accepted [1]. Example:

```ts
app.use(
  basicAuth({
    verifyUser: (username, password, c) => {
      return (
        username === 'dynamic-user' && password === 'hono-password'
      )
    },
  })
)
```
